From 01cb0b09b74edc9a510b91249783b9d30db3494e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dag Sommer <dagaleks@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 22:35:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] vendor: implement the Windows shim server (containerd PR
 #13948)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

containerd's pkg/shim/shim_windows.go stubs six functions with
errdefs.ErrNotImplemented: setupSignals, newServer, subreaper,
serveListener, reap and openLog. run() calls setupSignals before it
looks at the action argument, so on Windows every real shim action dies
at shim.go:228 before it begins. Measured on Windows 11 with the
unpatched binary: `-namespace default -id test start` exits 1 in 118 ms
with `io.containerd.nerdbox.v1: not implemented` on stderr, while `-v`
and `-info` work because run() returns before reaching setupSignals.

This is a hand-port of containerd/containerd PR #13948 ("[pkg/shim]
implement Windows support for the shim server", rawahars, opened
2026-08-12) onto nerdbox's vendored containerd v2.3.3. The PR IS NOT
MERGED UPSTREAM and has never been run against nerdbox by anyone; this
commit carries it the way packaging/libkrun-windows/ carries the libkrun
Windows series, and it should be deleted the moment #13948 lands and the
containerd dependency moves past it.

It is a hand-port rather than a straight `git apply` because the PR is
written against containerd main, whose copy of this file has already
drifted from the v2.3.3 one nerdbox vendors: main imports
golang.org/x/sys/windows and has a different awaitPipeReady. The
implementation bodies are taken verbatim from the PR; only the import
block and the placement around nerdbox's existing awaitPipeReady differ.
The PR's shim_windows_test.go is deliberately not carried — `go mod
vendor` strips _test.go files, so it could never run from vendor/.

This builds for windows/amd64. It has not been run. Building a shim is
not starting one.
---
 .../containerd/v2/pkg/shim/shim_windows.go    | 203 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 192 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vendor/github.com/containerd/containerd/v2/pkg/shim/shim_windows.go b/vendor/github.com/containerd/containerd/v2/pkg/shim/shim_windows.go
index b0b03c5..e37fd79 100644
--- a/vendor/github.com/containerd/containerd/v2/pkg/shim/shim_windows.go
+++ b/vendor/github.com/containerd/containerd/v2/pkg/shim/shim_windows.go
@@ -22,42 +22,133 @@ import (
